BEHAVIOR min

DESCRIPTION
  Smaller of two signed 64-bit integers.

CONTRACT
  INPUT a int 8
  INPUT b int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 506d7b8d

IMPLEMENTATION
  av = LOAD a 8
  bv = LOAD b 8
  a_smaller = ILT av bv 8
  BRANCH a_smaller take_a take_b

  LABEL take_a
    STORE result av 8
    JUMP end

  LABEL take_b
    STORE result bv 8

  LABEL end
END
